      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NUGGET ROBERTS (1) was safely held in tougher company last start after settling well back at this track, but prior to that won comfortably by 5.5 lengths at this track (23.23) beating Confetti Dan in a Grade 5 on November 5. Should be very hard to beat this time. MAKE A RUPEE (3) is worth forgiving for his last effort when fourth (17.29) at this track over 300m. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. WILGUNYA PRINCE (4) is a talented type who has been in the money at the last six starts, the latest finishing second (17.15) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning seven races. Has a good overall strike-rate and can find the frame here. LINE AND SINKER (5) was below best last time at this track (17.49) in a Grade 3/4, finishing a 7 length sixth. Has two wins already from this draw.",
